<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">Enhancing Generalization in Vision–Language–Action Models by Preserving Pretrained Representations
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Shresth Grover<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup><sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>,
Akshay Gopalkrishnan<sup id="id3" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup><sup id="id4" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>,
Bo Ai<sup id="id5" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>,
Henrik I. Christensen<sup id="id6" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>,
Hao Su<sup id="id7" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,2</span></sup>, and Xuanlin Li<sup id="id8" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2</span></sup>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>
</span>
