</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><a href="https://gen-vla.github.io" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">https://gen-vla.github.io</a>
